    "annotations": {
      "description": "The Kura fleet rollout stopped and will not move until someone resumes or aborts it from /ops/kura. A pause is the rollout's safety gate: either a health signal regressed on a scoped server, a wave could not converge within its one-hour deadline (wave_deadline_exceeded), or an operator paused it by hand. The fleet keeps serving on mixed versions meanwhile, so nothing is customer-visible yet; the risk is that it goes unnoticed for days. Open /ops/kura/rollouts for the pause reason, server and signal. For wave_deadline_exceeded, check the scoped StatefulSets for updateStrategy OnDelete or a partition left over from an incident before resuming.",
      "runbook_url": "https://github.com/tuist/tuist/blob/main/infra/helm/k8s-monitoring/alerts.md#kura-rollout-paused",
      "summary": "Kura rollout of {{ $labels.image_tag }} is paused in {{ $labels.env }}"
